WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:10.846
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:11.116 --> 00:13.118
[♪ opening theme music playing]

3
00:13.201 --> 00:14.661
[bird screeching]

4
00:38.143 --> 00:40.771
THE REMARRIED EMPRESS

5
00:41.938 --> 00:44.316
[♪ enchanting music playing]

6
00:45.734 --> 00:50.864
[Navier] "I will name the bird 'Queen,' but remember, he is male."

7
00:51.698 --> 00:52.783
[gasps softly]

8
00:53.825 --> 00:55.535
You're a male bird?

9
00:55.619 --> 00:57.954
[chirping]

10
00:58.038 --> 00:59.539
[chuckles softly]

11
00:59.623 --> 01:02.459
-Wonderful. -[chirping]

12
01:12.969 --> 01:16.431
I heard that you would eat fish, yet you haven't touched it.

13
01:16.515 --> 01:18.058
[chirping]

14
01:18.141 --> 01:20.602
So perhaps you'd prefer some sort of insect?

15
01:20.686 --> 01:21.728
[chirps]

16
01:21.812 --> 01:23.355
How about we try…

17
01:25.440 --> 01:26.817
caterpillars or flies?

18
01:26.900 --> 01:28.110
[chirps]

19
01:33.198 --> 01:34.866
[chuckles softly]

20
01:34.950 --> 01:36.201
Thank goodness.

21
01:36.284 --> 01:38.036
I'm quite afraid of insects.

22
01:38.745 --> 01:39.788
[chirps happily]

23
01:39.871 --> 01:41.039
[chuckles softly]

24
01:46.753 --> 01:47.921
[chirps]

25
01:55.262 --> 01:57.139
OFFICIAL DOCUMENT OF THE IMPERIAL HOUSEHOLD MISTRESS CONTRACT

26
01:57.806 --> 01:58.932
[chirps in alarm]

27
01:59.015 --> 02:01.101
-[♪ gentle music playing] -[Navier gasps softly]

28
02:01.184 --> 02:04.187
[chirping]

29
02:04.271 --> 02:05.397
Ah!

30
02:06.398 --> 02:09.693
I heard that a lot of birds like their feathers patted.

31
02:10.360 --> 02:11.570
Do you like that, too?

32
02:17.284 --> 02:18.285
[screeches happily]

33
02:18.368 --> 02:19.536
[Navier laughs]

34
02:20.620 --> 02:21.872
[chirping in excitement]

35
02:25.417 --> 02:27.544
You're adorable. [chuckles]

36
02:28.587 --> 02:29.880
[chirping]

37
02:29.963 --> 02:32.299
[♪ serene music playing]

38
03:11.129 --> 03:13.006
[♪ majestic orchestral music playing]

39
03:39.157 --> 03:41.284
How can you name a male "Queen"?

40
03:41.368 --> 03:42.702
What are you talking about?

41
03:44.037 --> 03:46.331
Weren't you out scouting like you were supposed to?

42
03:46.414 --> 03:48.416
Did you wander off somewhere else again?

43
03:49.334 --> 03:51.545
No. I was out scouting.

44
03:52.337 --> 03:54.422
[laughing] Scouting…

45
03:56.007 --> 03:57.717
into another woman's heart again?

46
03:59.177 --> 04:01.471
No, no, just the Imperial Palace.

47
04:01.555 --> 04:02.681
You shouldn't say that.

48
04:06.601 --> 04:07.602
[clicks tongue]

49
04:09.479 --> 04:10.730
Sire, please,

50
04:10.814 --> 04:13.358
I really need you to be more careful with how you act!

51
04:15.694 --> 04:18.154
You can't ever forget the fact that you are the first in line

52
04:18.238 --> 04:20.031
to the throne of the Western Kingdom.

53
04:24.995 --> 04:28.582
[Navier] "I wish I could be like Queen and fly the skies.

54
04:34.129 --> 04:37.215
"I wonder how the world would look from so high up.

55
04:40.176 --> 04:43.555
"Even majestic mountains and the boundless sea

56
04:43.638 --> 04:46.016
"would seem small from such heights.

57
04:48.476 --> 04:53.315
"How trivial and insignificant human worries and sorrows would become

58
04:53.398 --> 04:55.567
"when you're soaring through the clouds."

59
05:02.157 --> 05:03.658
OFFICIAL DOCUMENT OF THE IMPERIAL HOUSEHOLD MISTRESS CONTRACT

60
05:06.161 --> 05:09.372
EMPRESS NAVIER ELLIE TROVI

61
05:32.562 --> 05:34.564
[♪ serious music playing]

62
05:47.577 --> 05:48.703
[door opens]

63
05:55.168 --> 05:56.503
Her Majesty, sire.

64
05:56.586 --> 06:00.006
She's signed the contract that approves Ms. Rashta as your mistress.

65
06:00.090 --> 06:04.052
EMPEROR SOVIESHU TROVI VICTOR EMPRESS NAVIER ELLIE TROVI

66
06:05.095 --> 06:07.722
We'd usually hold a banquet to celebrate the registration.

67
06:07.806 --> 06:10.642
However, it coincides with the New Year's Ceremony.

68
06:11.226 --> 06:12.644
I'll meet the Empress soon.

69
06:12.727 --> 06:14.145
I'll talk with her.

70
06:15.397 --> 06:17.148
-Proceed. -Yes.

71
06:17.232 --> 06:20.944
Ah, and what shall we do about the request from Lady Albani?

72
06:25.448 --> 06:29.160
Are you saying His Majesty took the side of his mistress so blatantly?

73
06:29.244 --> 06:30.662
[noblewoman] Yes, right in front of Her Majesty

74
06:30.745 --> 06:32.247
and with all the ladies-in-waiting.

75
06:32.330 --> 06:35.417
Oh my. That puts the Empress in a very awkward position.

76
06:35.500 --> 06:37.794
It wasn't just awkward. It was humiliating.

77
06:37.877 --> 06:39.421
[♪ waltz music playing]

78
06:39.504 --> 06:42.257
You look even more beautiful today, Your Majesty.

79
06:47.053 --> 06:48.179
[Sovieshu] I'll do that.

80
06:54.519 --> 06:56.938
She told me she called you "sister."

81
06:58.481 --> 07:00.233
It was only later I realized

82
07:00.316 --> 07:03.445
how disconcerting that must have been for you.

83
07:08.616 --> 07:10.201
She only called you that

84
07:10.285 --> 07:14.289
as she thought I would feel more at ease if she got along with you like family.

85
07:14.372 --> 07:15.457
[chuckles softly]

86
07:16.082 --> 07:17.375
Isn't she innocent?

87
07:19.252 --> 07:20.462
[sighs softly]

88
07:22.839 --> 07:23.965
Let us begin.

89
07:24.048 --> 07:25.383
Yes, Your Majesty.

90
07:31.765 --> 07:34.058
Lady Albani had demands, I presume?

91
07:34.601 --> 07:37.103
Did she want recompense for sponsoring Ms. Rashta?

92
07:38.480 --> 07:40.523
Nothing is ever free in this world.

93
07:41.191 --> 07:42.192
Tell me…

94
07:43.735 --> 07:46.237
Did you grant a pardon for the Grand Duke, Your Majesty?

95
07:47.155 --> 07:48.573
Out of the question.

96
07:48.656 --> 07:52.744
I returned their family crest and estate in Lucevan, which I had seized.

97
07:55.330 --> 07:58.041
As for Rashta's banquet, we shall do as you wish.

98
07:58.124 --> 07:59.834
Then we shall abstain, Your Majesty.

99
08:03.171 --> 08:05.340
With so many important guests in attendance,

100
08:05.423 --> 08:07.342
the ceremony will not be eclipsed by scandal.

101
08:07.425 --> 08:09.010
I agree with you.

102
08:09.093 --> 08:11.721
It is the grandest festival of the Imperial Palace,

103
08:12.972 --> 08:14.307
and also a day for us.

104
08:17.477 --> 08:19.604
[painter] Please smile, Your Majesties.

105
08:24.818 --> 08:27.779
"A mistress cannot be entered into the imperial family register,

106
08:27.862 --> 08:29.489
"the same for any child born to her."

107
08:29.572 --> 08:32.075
"They cannot obtain the rights of imperial royalty."

108
08:34.285 --> 08:36.120
What does that mean though?

109
08:36.204 --> 08:38.665
It's saying that if you had any children,

110
08:38.748 --> 08:41.793
they cannot have the title "prince" or "princess," I'm afraid.

111
08:41.876 --> 08:43.419
-Even if the child is royal? -Yes.

112
08:43.503 --> 08:46.422
Even if you give birth to a child who looks identical to the Emperor,

113
08:46.506 --> 08:49.259
Eastern Empire laws require the descendants of a mistress

114
08:49.342 --> 08:50.844
to be managed in a separate genealogy.

115
08:50.927 --> 08:52.971
You may receive an allowance.

116
08:53.054 --> 08:54.764
But only whilst you're under contract.

117
08:54.848 --> 08:56.683
Therefore, once the contract ends,

118
08:56.766 --> 08:59.519
if it isn't renewed, you must leave the Imperial Palace.

119
09:00.562 --> 09:02.564
Are you saying the contract can end?

120
09:03.148 --> 09:06.568
Typically, the contract is renewed every two years.

121
09:06.651 --> 09:08.611
Uh… [clears throat] Here.

122
09:14.409 --> 09:15.952
[♪ amusing music playing]

123
09:18.288 --> 09:19.330
[sighs in exasperation]

124
09:20.957 --> 09:23.209
-Would you excuse us? -Yes.

125
09:28.423 --> 09:29.424
Here.

126
09:35.346 --> 09:36.347
MISTRESS CONTRACT

127
09:36.431 --> 09:37.682
Now, just here,

128
09:37.765 --> 09:40.268
beside Her Majesty's signature is your name.

129
09:42.187 --> 09:43.730
You cannot… You're…

130
09:44.314 --> 09:46.399
-You're illiterate. -[sighs softly]

131
09:51.029 --> 09:52.238
RASHTA ISHKA BOTULIN

132
09:53.489 --> 09:55.033
This is how your name is written.

133
10:04.584 --> 10:05.752
Rashta.

134
10:07.921 --> 10:10.924
Ish… ka.

135
10:12.217 --> 10:13.593
Boo…

136
10:14.886 --> 10:17.180
tuh…

137
10:19.474 --> 10:21.517
RASHTA ISHKA BOTULIN

138
10:21.601 --> 10:24.270
…lin.

139
10:24.354 --> 10:25.980
-[sighs in relief] -[sighs in relief]

140
10:28.191 --> 10:29.901
You are all done. [chuckles softly]

141
10:29.984 --> 10:31.236
I'm sorry…

142
10:31.903 --> 10:34.614
Can you give Ms. Rashta and I some time alone, please?

143
10:34.697 --> 10:37.116
She'll have questions about life in the Imperial Palace

144
10:37.200 --> 10:38.743
and may have concerns

145
10:38.826 --> 10:40.620
that she can only confide to another woman.

146
10:44.749 --> 10:47.710
-[door closes] -This is different from what I hoped.

147
10:47.794 --> 10:50.964
I heard I won't have a celebratory banquet due to the New Year's Ceremony.

148
10:51.047 --> 10:53.424
I thought His Majesty would at least be here

149
10:53.508 --> 10:56.302
and celebrate with me and show his gratitude.

150
10:56.386 --> 11:00.056
With the New Year's Ceremony so close, His Majesty is indisposed.

151
11:00.139 --> 11:01.516
Also, look at the contract.

152
11:01.599 --> 11:05.311
He can keep me around for two years, then throw me out once he grows tired.

153
11:05.895 --> 11:08.940
[gasps] Rashta, now see here!

154
11:11.484 --> 11:12.777
Don't you understand

155
11:12.860 --> 11:15.321
that from now, you're a daughter of Botulin House?

156
11:15.405 --> 11:18.366
Being thrown out, now that you're one of us, will never happen.

157
11:19.325 --> 11:20.410
I say so.

158
11:20.493 --> 11:22.161
[♪ soft music playing]

159
11:22.245 --> 11:23.246
[snaps fingers]

160
11:24.747 --> 11:27.292
These are black diamonds. Aren't they lovely?

161
11:28.960 --> 11:32.297
They are only for the women of Botulin House.

162
11:33.381 --> 11:34.507
Here.

163
11:50.898 --> 11:54.652
Congratulations on becoming His Majesty's woman.

164
11:54.736 --> 11:56.237
[♪ music swells]

165
12:06.539 --> 12:10.376
I will set a suitable date for a banquet in your honor, Ms. Rashta.

166
12:11.669 --> 12:13.171
Keep your chin tucked in,

167
12:13.254 --> 12:16.174
lift your chest, keep your back straight,

168
12:16.758 --> 12:18.593
and your gaze forward.

169
12:19.218 --> 12:22.638
I will turn you into a noble lady,

170
12:22.722 --> 12:27.185
who is suited to His Majesty and his way of life.

171
12:29.854 --> 12:30.897
[horse whinnies]

172
12:33.066 --> 12:34.067
[Minister of Finance] 2,000 fireworks,

173
12:34.150 --> 12:36.361
5,000 packs of cigarettes,

174
12:36.444 --> 12:39.197
300 casks of whiskey, 400 boxes of caviar,

175
12:39.280 --> 12:41.032
200 horses and 50 carriages.

176
12:41.115 --> 12:43.618
As for meat… beef, mutton, and chicken.

177
12:43.701 --> 12:46.412
And finally, we have 5,000 kegs of beer.

178
12:46.496 --> 12:47.955
Thank you.

179
12:48.039 --> 12:50.541
See that it's well prepared for our subjects to enjoy,

180
12:50.625 --> 12:51.626
as well as our guests.

181
12:51.709 --> 12:53.211
Yes.

182
12:55.922 --> 12:58.966
It is today that Laura's punishment ends, is it not?

183
12:59.050 --> 13:00.134
-Yes. -Yes.

184
13:00.760 --> 13:03.805
Our other engagement, the dress fitting, you can postpone it.

185
13:04.806 --> 13:07.683
I will prepare to fetch Lady Laura.

186
13:15.817 --> 13:17.026
[birds chirping]

187
13:17.110 --> 13:18.111
Sister!

188
13:26.035 --> 13:27.412
Good day, Your Majesty.

189
13:29.497 --> 13:32.125
I was just on my way to see you, my lady.

190
13:33.084 --> 13:35.378
I have something to share with Your Majesty.

191
13:35.461 --> 13:37.255
My adoptive mother gave me caramels.

192
13:37.338 --> 13:39.715
They're so delicious I thought you'd like to try a piece.

193
13:47.223 --> 13:48.391
Your Majesty…

194
13:49.475 --> 13:52.228
why do you have such a scary look on your face?

195
13:53.479 --> 13:54.897
I do not want you to bring me things.

196
13:55.940 --> 13:57.358
And also…

197
13:58.317 --> 13:59.485
refrain from visiting me.

198
14:00.069 --> 14:03.322
It's not as though we are on such terms that we enjoy seeing each other.

199
14:04.699 --> 14:06.742
Then we can try and get on good terms. I…

200
14:07.326 --> 14:10.746
I'd like to become close friends with Your Majesty.

201
14:12.748 --> 14:14.167
There's no need to act this way.

202
14:14.250 --> 14:15.877
When the next mistress arrives,

203
14:16.586 --> 14:19.088
you can become close with her instead of me.

204
14:21.007 --> 14:22.550
"The next mistress"?

205
14:23.176 --> 14:24.677
But of course.

206
14:24.760 --> 14:26.596
There will be others once he's done with you.

207
14:27.180 --> 14:28.431
[gasps softly]

208
14:28.514 --> 14:30.099
If you just wait a little,

209
14:30.725 --> 14:32.852
you will make plenty of friends.

210
14:32.935 --> 14:36.439
The previous emperor had eight mistresses.

211
14:36.522 --> 14:38.524
[♪ moody music playing]

212
14:38.608 --> 14:42.361
With that many, you can play the ball game that's popular among the citizen class.

213
14:42.945 --> 14:44.822
Wouldn't you enjoy that?

214
14:46.574 --> 14:47.742
[chuckles softly]

215
14:53.873 --> 14:55.583
[♪ music continues]

216
15:10.681 --> 15:11.766
[Laura gasps]

217
15:12.350 --> 15:13.351
Your Majesty!

218
15:15.394 --> 15:16.687
[Laura grunts]

219
15:17.396 --> 15:18.773
Your… Your Majesty.

220
15:18.856 --> 15:20.900
[Laura grunts]

221
15:20.983 --> 15:22.235
[Laura breathing shakily]

222
15:25.655 --> 15:27.114
[sobbing softly]

223
15:29.533 --> 15:31.244
[Verdi] You stayed strong.

224
15:31.327 --> 15:32.912
You did so well, Laura.

225
15:32.995 --> 15:34.330
[Laura sobbing]

226
15:38.334 --> 15:40.169
[Laura] I'll be okay.

227
15:40.962 --> 15:42.630
[Laura sobbing]

228
15:50.429 --> 15:51.931
[♪ tense music playing]

229
16:20.501 --> 16:22.169
I'm here as you requested.

230
16:25.256 --> 16:26.299
What is it?

231
16:26.882 --> 16:28.342
Your lady-in-waiting…

232
16:29.176 --> 16:31.053
the one who was punished…

233
16:31.595 --> 16:33.264
Daughter of a Marquess.

234
16:34.348 --> 16:36.100
And her name is Laura Tallital.

235
16:40.563 --> 16:42.106
I heard you went

236
16:42.898 --> 16:44.984
-[thuds loudly] -and took her…

237
16:46.235 --> 16:47.653
My lady-in-waiting…

238
16:48.237 --> 16:50.114
suffered for five whole days.

239
16:51.574 --> 16:53.784
Did you really have to do that?

240
16:54.744 --> 16:55.995
How does it make me look

241
16:56.078 --> 16:58.998
if you go out of your way to care for someone I punished?

242
17:01.959 --> 17:04.253
Instead of going to the prison to fetch her…

243
17:07.214 --> 17:11.010
you should have cast her out of the Imperial Palace.

244
17:11.093 --> 17:13.804
She was only punished for my sake, Your Majesty.

245
17:13.888 --> 17:15.765
It would not be right if she were banished.

246
17:15.848 --> 17:18.517
Besides, her actions made sense.

247
17:19.185 --> 17:20.686
She merely defended her Empress.

248
17:20.770 --> 17:22.188
[Sovieshu clicks tongue]

249
17:22.271 --> 17:23.647
[scoffs]

250
17:24.482 --> 17:27.068
So you will take her side to the very end?

251
17:27.151 --> 17:29.820
Those ladies are under my authority.

252
17:29.904 --> 17:31.697
They should only have to answer to me.

253
17:31.781 --> 17:34.825
How dare you defend the person that humiliated Rashta?

254
17:35.910 --> 17:36.911
[clatters]

255
17:38.162 --> 17:41.666
And you said such spiteful things to that poor girl who knows nothing.

256
17:41.749 --> 17:43.250
Why have you changed so much?

257
17:43.918 --> 17:44.919
I was spiteful?

258
17:45.002 --> 17:47.755
I heard you told Rashta that I would take another mistress.

259
17:49.173 --> 17:51.550
Historically, the emperor never takes one.

260
17:51.634 --> 17:53.469
He takes as many as he pleases.

261
17:54.136 --> 17:55.888
Have you forgotten your promise…

262
17:56.972 --> 17:59.392
that you would never take one yourself?

263
17:59.475 --> 18:04.021
You said that you would not embarrass your empress as the previous was

264
18:04.855 --> 18:05.940
and let me suffer.

265
18:06.857 --> 18:09.318
You say Lady Laura humiliated Rashta.

266
18:09.402 --> 18:13.489
Was it not the same humiliation to condemn her to prison?

267
18:14.740 --> 18:16.701
She is my lady-in-waiting.

268
18:17.576 --> 18:19.787
Your Majesty only chose to punish Laura

269
18:19.870 --> 18:22.331
to flaunt your command in front of your mistress.

270
18:24.125 --> 18:25.668
Anything to please her.

271
18:26.168 --> 18:29.171
You'll even send the daughter of a noble house to prison.

272
18:29.255 --> 18:30.631
It was performative power.

273
18:31.173 --> 18:33.134
-Enough! -I'm now laughingstock.

274
18:33.843 --> 18:35.261
You say I've changed?

275
18:36.470 --> 18:39.098
Lady Laura has borne the brunt of your harsh actions…

276
18:44.353 --> 18:46.522
and it has brought disgrace on her family.

277
18:47.857 --> 18:49.650
Your Majesty, it isn't me…

278
18:51.360 --> 18:52.903
but you who's been changed.

279
19:01.829 --> 19:03.831
[♪ music continues]

280
19:10.713 --> 19:11.756
[door shuts]

281
19:17.052 --> 19:18.387
[door opens]

282
19:32.359 --> 19:33.360
You've returned.

283
19:34.403 --> 19:35.696
Where's Lady Laura?

284
19:35.780 --> 19:37.615
We are taking care of her as you asked, Your Majesty.

285
19:38.199 --> 19:39.492
So please, do not worry.

286
19:40.159 --> 19:41.911
In your chamber, there's a gift for you.

287
19:41.994 --> 19:44.455
It arrived today, from Duchess Trovi.

288
19:44.538 --> 19:45.581
From Mother?

289
20:22.368 --> 20:24.370
[♪ gentle music playing]

290
20:26.664 --> 20:28.499
[Duchess Trovi] "To Her Majesty the Empress.

291
20:28.582 --> 20:32.253
"I had very much wished to attend this New Year's Ceremony and see you.

292
20:32.336 --> 20:36.257
"However, I decided that I must be patient for a little longer.

293
20:36.340 --> 20:38.843
"I found myself recalling the very first time

294
20:38.926 --> 20:41.262
"I made clothes for you before you were born.

295
20:41.762 --> 20:44.557
"Back then, even the smallest piece of fabric

296
20:44.640 --> 20:46.892
"was enough to wrap around you."

297
20:46.976 --> 20:48.143
Little one…

298
20:49.103 --> 20:51.564
Your mother will make sure you look lovely.

299
20:52.439 --> 20:55.109
"It was true before you came into this world,

300
20:55.192 --> 20:56.443
"and remains so now.

301
20:56.527 --> 20:58.696
"You are my most darling treasure.

302
20:59.280 --> 21:02.908
"I hope this dress will bring Your Majesty great comfort and bravery.

303
21:03.492 --> 21:05.494
"The Duke also sends his regards.

304
21:05.578 --> 21:09.164
"Whenever he misses you, he gazes upon the olive tree you planted."

305
21:09.248 --> 21:10.291
[sighs]

306
21:10.374 --> 21:12.960
"That tree now casts quite a big shadow.

307
21:13.043 --> 21:14.253
"My beloved Majesty.

308
21:14.336 --> 21:15.921
"Please take courage!"

309
21:16.463 --> 21:20.134
[Kosair] "To my beloved younger sister, Her Majesty the Empress.

310
21:20.217 --> 21:22.261
"We fought another small battle today.

311
21:22.845 --> 21:24.597
"We are clearing out the remnant forces,

312
21:24.680 --> 21:26.891
"so we may be able to move up the peace talks.

313
21:26.974 --> 21:28.809
"If these talks make progress,

314
21:28.893 --> 21:32.396
"the greatest threat to the Eastern Empire may disappear.

315
21:32.479 --> 21:35.983
"Your Majesty, I heard the news about the Emperor's mistress.

316
21:36.066 --> 21:41.655
"Our parents were deeply shocked as well, but they seemed concerned only for you.

317
21:41.739 --> 21:43.908
"I believe in you, Your Majesty.

318
21:43.991 --> 21:45.743
"I know how strong you are.

319
21:45.826 --> 21:46.994
"If only I were near you,

320
21:47.077 --> 21:50.372
"I would have beaten that rascal until he was black and blue!

321
21:51.123 --> 21:54.126
"I will come to see you soon, Your Majesty.

322
21:54.209 --> 21:57.212
"Until then, please stay well."

323
22:14.855 --> 22:16.190
[sniffling]

324
22:23.614 --> 22:24.865
[sobbing]

325
22:37.628 --> 22:39.880
[fireworks whistling]

326
22:41.173 --> 22:42.424
[fireworks bursting]

327
22:53.185 --> 22:54.353
[McKenna] Oh!

328
22:55.145 --> 22:57.022
Wow!

329
22:57.106 --> 22:58.607
Ooh!

330
23:00.025 --> 23:01.318
[McKenna laughing]

331
23:02.069 --> 23:03.445
Look there!

332
23:14.206 --> 23:15.916
[fireworks bursting]

333
23:22.006 --> 23:23.590
[fireworks continue bursting]

334
23:29.722 --> 23:31.056
[♪ grand music playing]

335
23:32.725 --> 23:34.435
[lady-in-waiting] Careful, don't damage the flowers.

336
23:35.436 --> 23:36.437
Hurry now!

337
24:02.129 --> 24:04.089
[♪ music swells]

338
24:13.974 --> 24:15.225
[horse whinnies]

339
24:43.796 --> 24:46.548
[mutters softly] Why would he walk backwards like that?

340
24:46.632 --> 24:48.884
It's dangerous. [chuckles]

341
24:52.471 --> 24:53.597
[♪ music fades]

342
24:53.680 --> 24:56.683
We've allocated 110,000 krang for the foreign delegation banquet

343
24:56.767 --> 24:59.394
and 50,000 krang to enhance the military band

344
24:59.478 --> 25:00.646
for the commemorative parade.

345
25:00.729 --> 25:02.064
That sounds perfect.

346
25:02.147 --> 25:03.649
Thank you for your work.

347
25:04.316 --> 25:07.945
Your Majesty, we've received a request for you to welcome a delegation.

348
25:08.779 --> 25:10.322
It's the Western Kingdom.

349
25:10.405 --> 25:11.573
The Western Kingdom?

350
25:12.699 --> 25:14.118
Yes, it's Prince Heinrey.

351
25:18.330 --> 25:20.082
COMMEMORATING THE 100TH ANNIVERSARY OF THE FOUNDING

352
25:20.165 --> 25:21.834
OF THE EMPIRE NEW YEAR'S CEREMONY ADDITIONAL BUDGET DOCUMENT

353
25:25.087 --> 25:27.089
[♪ gentle music playing]

354
26:56.345 --> 26:57.846
[clears throat softly]

355
27:05.103 --> 27:07.689
It is my honor to meet you,

356
27:08.607 --> 27:09.858
my queen.

357
27:12.903 --> 27:16.198
I'm also honored to make your acquaintance, Prince Heinrey.

358
27:24.498 --> 27:26.708
You must be tired after your long journey.

359
27:27.292 --> 27:30.921
You should rest here in the palace until the New Year's Ceremony begins.

360
27:32.214 --> 27:35.092
The Eastern Empire's Imperial Palace is renowned…

361
27:35.968 --> 27:37.344
for its great beauty.

362
27:37.427 --> 27:39.221
I'm certain you will like it.

363
27:40.973 --> 27:41.974
I'm already…

364
27:43.767 --> 27:45.018
enamored by it.

365
27:53.652 --> 27:55.779
[♪ bright, playful music playing]

366
27:59.533 --> 28:02.411
[McKenna] Why are you staring so intently, Your Highness?

367
28:02.494 --> 28:04.579
Please avert your gaze.

368
28:06.581 --> 28:07.708
[McKenna grunts]

369
28:11.795 --> 28:15.298
[Verdi] I'd like to welcome Princess Circe of the Southern Kingdom

370
28:15.382 --> 28:18.552
and Grand Duke Kaufman of the Kingdom of Luipt.

371
28:35.902 --> 28:39.322
What has you so preoccupied, Your Highness?

372
28:44.202 --> 28:45.203
Whoa!

373
28:45.287 --> 28:46.955
This… Hmm.

374
28:47.581 --> 28:49.458
Whoa! [chuckles]

375
28:49.541 --> 28:50.959
Whoa!

376
28:51.043 --> 28:52.627
This palace is just…

377
28:52.711 --> 28:55.130
so huge and lavish!

378
28:55.797 --> 28:57.132
Wow!

379
28:57.215 --> 28:59.843
[scoffs] This… this is from that place!

380
28:59.926 --> 29:03.638
Wow, the Eastern Empire really is a bunch of thieves

381
29:03.722 --> 29:06.308
taking the spoils from the war and putting them on display

382
29:06.391 --> 29:08.894
-as if they had always belonged to them. -[♪ bright music playing]

383
29:08.977 --> 29:10.479
-Isn't that too much? -[sighs]

384
29:10.562 --> 29:11.855
Wow!

385
29:13.190 --> 29:14.316
Don't you think so?

386
29:15.442 --> 29:16.985
Uh… Your Highness?

387
29:19.654 --> 29:20.697
Your Highness!

388
29:21.573 --> 29:23.158
Are you going off somewhere again?

389
29:25.327 --> 29:27.329
-[Heinrey sighs] -[birds chirping]

390
29:30.332 --> 29:31.333
I'll return soon.

391
29:31.416 --> 29:32.459
[clicks tongue]

392
29:32.542 --> 29:33.794
Where are you going?

393
29:34.836 --> 29:36.338
There are too many eyes!

394
29:36.421 --> 29:38.131
-Your Highness! -[screeching]

395
29:38.215 --> 29:39.591
Where are you going?

396
29:39.674 --> 29:42.427
Where are you… Ugh, seriously?

397
29:42.511 --> 29:44.262
[noblewomen laughing]

398
29:47.182 --> 29:49.017
You're coming back from meeting the delegation

399
29:49.101 --> 29:50.227
of the Western Kingdom, aren't you?

400
29:50.811 --> 29:52.187
Please, do tell them.

401
29:52.270 --> 29:54.231
Is he really as beautiful as they say?

402
29:55.607 --> 29:57.359
[Laura] I heard one of the maids in the South Palace

403
29:57.442 --> 29:59.945
was so overwhelmed by his beauty that she fainted.

404
30:00.028 --> 30:01.696
[noblewoman 1] Oh, she fainted?

405
30:02.364 --> 30:03.406
Oh!

406
30:03.490 --> 30:05.033
[noblewoman 2] Is he that beautiful?

407
30:11.331 --> 30:13.166
He was the most beautiful person

408
30:15.335 --> 30:16.628
that I've ever met.

409
30:16.711 --> 30:18.296
-[noblewomen gasp] -[noblewoman 3] Such chiseled features!

410
30:18.380 --> 30:21.800
His appearance made me question if he was even human.

411
30:21.883 --> 30:22.884
[noblewomen gasp]

412
30:23.426 --> 30:24.886
[noblewoman 4] Did it really?

413
30:26.138 --> 30:28.598
Uh… what's his voice like?

414
30:28.682 --> 30:29.683
[noblewoman 5] Yes?

415
30:30.350 --> 30:31.768
[chirps]

416
30:32.811 --> 30:34.771
Out of everyone I've spoken to…

417
30:36.982 --> 30:38.525
his voice was the most lovely.

418
30:38.608 --> 30:39.901
[all gasp]

419
30:40.360 --> 30:41.820
-A man like that… -[chirping]

420
30:41.903 --> 30:44.531
I'm not at all surprised that rumors surround him.

421
30:45.407 --> 30:48.702
Even if he just stands quietly and keeps to himself.

422
30:48.785 --> 30:50.620
[noblewoman 6] Oh, he has a beautiful voice, too?

423
30:50.704 --> 30:51.705
That's too much!

424
30:51.788 --> 30:52.956
[indistinct chatter]

425
30:53.748 --> 30:55.709
[Laura] I think we should be wary of Prince Heinrey.

426
30:55.792 --> 30:57.502
He's very dangerous.

427
30:57.586 --> 30:59.546
I mean, one maid fainted.

428
30:59.629 --> 31:02.757
And you must have heard what happened to that other maid.

429
31:04.384 --> 31:05.385
[chuckles softly]

430
31:05.468 --> 31:07.262
[♪ enchanting music playing]

431
31:07.345 --> 31:08.513
-Queen! -[door closes]

432
31:08.597 --> 31:11.016
-[chirps] -[Navier laughing]

433
31:11.099 --> 31:12.559
[chirping]

434
31:20.025 --> 31:21.484
If he's responded so quickly,

435
31:22.110 --> 31:24.779
then surely your master is almost here.

436
31:25.780 --> 31:26.865
[chirping]

437
31:27.782 --> 31:31.620
"I have arrived at the Imperial Palace. Can you guess who I am?"

438
31:33.038 --> 31:34.039
Wait, he's with you?

439
31:35.081 --> 31:36.082
[chirps]

440
31:47.177 --> 31:48.970
Where's your master?

441
31:49.054 --> 31:50.180
Is he among those guests?

442
31:50.263 --> 31:52.098
[chirping]

443
31:57.646 --> 31:59.648
I do not know who you are.

444
32:00.565 --> 32:03.568
But tell me, do you know who I am?

445
32:04.361 --> 32:05.362
[♪ music fades]

446
32:05.445 --> 32:07.239
[thunder rumbling]

447
32:09.616 --> 32:11.243
[thunder roaring]

448
32:13.620 --> 32:15.622
-[Marquess Lante] Come on, hurry up. -[maid] Yes, sir.

449
32:16.206 --> 32:17.207
[Marquess Lante] Yes, over there.

450
32:17.290 --> 32:18.583
[thunder rumbling]

451
32:19.751 --> 32:21.628
[Eliza] Please, it is so very late.

452
32:22.212 --> 32:23.755
Go to bed, Your Majesty.

453
32:24.923 --> 32:27.133
I hope the rain ceases before the morning.

454
32:29.177 --> 32:30.178
Come now.

455
32:31.554 --> 32:34.516
You are the one who must shine the brightest in this palace,

456
32:34.599 --> 32:36.017
so you cannot stay up late.

457
32:38.019 --> 32:39.145
[Navier sighs]

458
32:42.816 --> 32:44.943
Is the South Palace comfortable for the guests?

459
32:45.026 --> 32:46.820
They are all in high spirits

460
32:46.903 --> 32:49.572
and seem to have no intention of calling it a night.

461
32:49.656 --> 32:51.574
They're still drinking, my lady.

462
32:51.658 --> 32:53.743
-They are? -What I've heard

463
32:53.827 --> 32:57.706
is the ladies are pining so ardently over Prince Heinrey.

464
32:57.789 --> 32:59.791
They say they have formed ranks.

465
32:59.874 --> 33:01.501
Those who have exchanged words,

466
33:01.584 --> 33:03.211
those who have made eye contact,

467
33:03.295 --> 33:04.796
and those he has smiled at.

468
33:05.880 --> 33:09.175
I think what the ladies really want to know is

469
33:09.259 --> 33:11.136
who the prince will dance with first.

470
33:12.637 --> 33:14.514
So which lady do you think is most likely?

471
33:15.307 --> 33:18.977
There are talks of Duchess Tuania, others say Princess Circe.

472
33:19.060 --> 33:20.603
There are divided opinions.

473
33:20.687 --> 33:23.315
Although I'm sure they're all thinking the same thing.

474
33:23.398 --> 33:26.443
They all wish he'll walk over to them,

475
33:26.526 --> 33:28.486
take their hand and dance the night away.

476
33:28.570 --> 33:29.821
[gasps] What a dream!

477
33:29.904 --> 33:31.781
[Navier laughing]

478
33:31.865 --> 33:33.450
[Eliza laughing]

479
33:33.533 --> 33:35.118
Good night, Your Majesty.

480
33:41.666 --> 33:43.084
[thunder cracking]

481
33:43.168 --> 33:44.294
[thuds]

482
33:48.298 --> 33:49.966
Oh, my goodness!

483
33:51.551 --> 33:53.136
[chirps]

484
33:57.599 --> 33:58.725
[chirps]

485
33:58.808 --> 34:00.560
[♪ gentle music playing]

486
34:02.062 --> 34:03.271
Oh, good heavens!

487
34:04.314 --> 34:05.398
It's raining so hard.

488
34:05.482 --> 34:07.650
Did your master really make you fly here?

489
34:09.277 --> 34:10.362
[sighs]

490
34:13.365 --> 34:15.658
How long have you been waiting?

491
34:16.242 --> 34:17.285
Are you all right?

492
34:19.621 --> 34:21.164
[chirps]

493
34:21.790 --> 34:22.999
[sighs]

494
34:27.587 --> 34:31.716
[Heinrey] "Shall we make a bet? Whoever finds the other first wins!"

495
34:48.775 --> 34:51.945
[Navier] "If it is a bet, what will you wager?"

496
34:56.241 --> 34:57.784
[thunder rumbling]

497
34:57.867 --> 34:59.035
[thunder cracks]

498
35:00.120 --> 35:01.413
[gasps]

499
35:01.496 --> 35:02.956
[chirps]

500
35:04.332 --> 35:05.625
I cannot do this.

501
35:06.251 --> 35:08.253
I'm not sending you outside in this weather.

502
35:10.922 --> 35:12.215
Why don't you stay here tonight?

503
35:12.298 --> 35:13.967
[chirping]

504
35:14.050 --> 35:17.303
You will return to your master when it stops raining.

505
35:17.387 --> 35:18.471
[chirps]

506
35:37.741 --> 35:40.118
I find myself wondering what your master's like.

507
35:42.620 --> 35:44.497
Is he sweet and clever, like you?

508
35:49.502 --> 35:51.963
Come to think of it, Prince Heinrey…

509
35:52.547 --> 35:54.758
He has eyes as purple as yours.

510
35:54.841 --> 35:57.385
I'm already enamored by it.

511
36:00.013 --> 36:02.932
[cooing]

512
36:03.725 --> 36:05.769
You are so pretty, Queen.

513
36:10.106 --> 36:11.107
Good night.

514
36:22.827 --> 36:25.163
[rain pattering]

515
36:39.886 --> 36:43.973
-[♪ music continues] -[birds chirping]

516
37:49.080 --> 37:50.248
[Albani] Begin.

517
37:50.331 --> 37:53.209
[♪ amusing music playing]

518
37:53.793 --> 37:54.878
Good!

519
37:54.961 --> 37:56.963
Very good so far.

520
37:57.046 --> 37:59.090
Slowly. That's it.

521
37:59.173 --> 38:00.550
Keep your balance.

522
38:01.134 --> 38:02.510
Oh!

523
38:02.594 --> 38:03.720
Very good.

524
38:03.803 --> 38:05.555
Now we'll try without the book.

525
38:05.638 --> 38:07.432
There. Bup-bup-bup-bup-bup.

526
38:07.515 --> 38:09.017
You need to walk slower.

527
38:11.728 --> 38:12.812
Like this?

528
38:12.896 --> 38:14.856
That's right.

529
38:14.939 --> 38:17.984
You should always be mindful of the maids' strides

530
38:18.067 --> 38:19.986
following behind you.

531
38:20.069 --> 38:23.156
Slowly, so the maids can follow…

532
38:23.239 --> 38:24.324
What are you doing?

533
38:24.407 --> 38:26.367
No, don't match your stride to theirs.

534
38:26.451 --> 38:27.535
If you aren't quick enough,

535
38:27.619 --> 38:29.120
then those lowly creatures will step on your dress.

536
38:29.203 --> 38:31.873
[groans] Then how exactly should I walk?

537
38:31.956 --> 38:33.666
They should match what I do.

538
38:33.750 --> 38:35.001
You should walk in a way

539
38:35.084 --> 38:37.545
that never lets those following you relax at all.

540
38:37.629 --> 38:40.673
That way, they never forget that you are their mistress.

541
38:40.757 --> 38:42.842
[sighs in exasperation] This is hard!

542
38:42.926 --> 38:44.552
Well, yes, it should be hard.

543
38:44.636 --> 38:46.179
How are the writing lessons?

544
38:47.430 --> 38:50.016
Reading is a little easier,

545
38:50.099 --> 38:51.643
-the writing is… -Hmm.

546
38:51.726 --> 38:54.395
Well then, it looks like you will continue your lessons

547
38:54.479 --> 38:56.147
during the New Year's Ceremony.

548
38:56.773 --> 38:58.524
I'll be tired after all the parties I'll attend.

549
38:58.608 --> 38:59.901
[scoffs] Listen.

550
38:59.984 --> 39:01.569
Relax your eyebrows. Shoulders straight.

551
39:01.653 --> 39:03.071
Chest up, too.

552
39:03.154 --> 39:04.197
Chin.

553
39:04.280 --> 39:05.740
Corners of your mouth.

554
39:06.449 --> 39:09.118
Next. Yes, your gaze.

555
39:09.744 --> 39:11.204
Mmm.

556
39:11.287 --> 39:12.538
Well done.

557
39:13.206 --> 39:14.415
Beautiful!

558
39:22.131 --> 39:24.884
[♪ grand music playing]

559
39:29.222 --> 39:32.392
Now, ladies, a busy day of preparation is ahead. Understood?

560
39:33.101 --> 39:36.062
Of course. We've begun the preparations already, Countess.

561
39:37.814 --> 39:39.148
-Ta-da! -Ta-da!

562
39:39.232 --> 39:40.274
[both giggle]

563
39:48.616 --> 39:50.618
[♪ music swells]

564
40:33.578 --> 40:34.829
Countess?

565
40:34.912 --> 40:37.832
Do you think Rashta will also be at the ceremony?

566
40:37.915 --> 40:39.834
I suppose she will attend.

567
40:39.917 --> 40:41.502
As the girl is now…

568
40:41.586 --> 40:43.796
-a daughter of the Botulin House. -[Marquess Lante clears throat]

569
40:43.880 --> 40:47.258
[courtier] His Majesty the Emperor and Her Majesty the Empress.

570
40:47.341 --> 40:50.053
[♪ fanfare playing]

571
40:57.935 --> 40:59.771
[crowd clapping]

572
40:59.854 --> 41:02.065
[♪ captivating music playing]

573
41:44.107 --> 41:47.860
As you know, I played a part in the war of a Hundred Years.

574
41:48.444 --> 41:50.446
I loyally followed my predecessor.

575
41:50.530 --> 41:53.157
It was so cold that even the strongest liquor froze.

576
41:55.076 --> 41:56.994
The horses turned to ice in death.

577
41:57.078 --> 41:58.079
The frost…

578
41:58.788 --> 42:01.374
rendered the bread impossible to chew.

579
42:01.457 --> 42:03.876
The cold armor clung to our skin so tightly

580
42:03.960 --> 42:05.753
that we could not even prize it off.

581
42:05.837 --> 42:08.756
[Navier] The cold armor clung to our skin so tightly

582
42:08.840 --> 42:10.925
that we could not even prize it off,

583
42:11.592 --> 42:16.389
and only the hot blood of our enemies could melt away the biting cold.

584
42:17.807 --> 42:19.809
[Sovieshu] And only the hot blood of our enemies

585
42:19.892 --> 42:21.894
could melt away the biting cold.

586
42:23.896 --> 42:25.398
When the Hundred Years' War ended,

587
42:26.274 --> 42:27.525
peace fell upon us all.

588
42:28.109 --> 42:29.443
And yet,

589
42:29.527 --> 42:32.989
our swords and our shields, they have not rusted at all.

590
42:33.072 --> 42:34.407
This peace eternal

591
42:34.490 --> 42:38.494
can only be protected by readied armor and a blade that shines.

592
42:39.287 --> 42:41.914
A blade that is ready to be drawn at any moment.

593
42:41.998 --> 42:43.124
And I…

594
42:43.207 --> 42:45.042
will preserve and defend our empire.

595
42:45.126 --> 42:48.921
and we shall see that this strength and peace lasts

596
42:49.005 --> 42:51.048
for 10,000 years.

597
42:52.633 --> 42:54.552
[♪ music crescendos]

598
42:56.429 --> 42:58.431
I share this glory with you.

599
43:12.737 --> 43:13.738
Join me!

600
43:13.821 --> 43:16.365
[all] Long live His Majesty the Emperor!

601
43:16.449 --> 43:17.491
The Emperor!

602
43:17.575 --> 43:21.412
Long live Her Majesty the Empress! The Empress!

603
43:23.706 --> 43:25.833
-[♪ band playing waltz music] -[guests chatter]

604
43:34.592 --> 43:37.178
It has been a long time, Lady Albani.

605
43:37.261 --> 43:38.930
-[Sirim] Lady Albani! -Good to see you.

606
43:39.013 --> 43:40.932
-Nice to meet you. -[Albani chuckles softly]

607
43:41.515 --> 43:42.558
[chuckles softly]

608
44:01.077 --> 44:02.119
[Sovieshu exhales]

609
44:04.038 --> 44:06.165
I was hoping I could dance with Rashta first.

610
44:07.959 --> 44:10.419
After all, our only rehearsal was to this piece.

611
44:12.880 --> 44:14.548
I'll see you later.

612
44:15.258 --> 44:16.467
